    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- New package based on version 23.1.0.
  * For details, see the release notes:
    - https://releases.llvm.org/23.1.0/docs/ReleaseNotes.html
    - https://releases.llvm.org/23.1.0/tools/clang/docs/ReleaseNotes.html
    - https://releases.llvm.org/23.1.0/tools/clang/tools/extra/docs/ReleaseNotes.html
    - https://releases.llvm.org/23.1.0/projects/libcxx/docs/ReleaseNotes.html
    - https://releases.llvm.org/23.1.0/tools/lld/docs/ReleaseNotes.html
  * New LLVM tools:
    - llubi is an UB-aware interpreter for LLVM IR.
    - llvm-extract-offload-entry can extract an offload bundle
      entry from a binary.
    - llvm-gpu-loader can launch programs on the GPU.
  * New Clang tools for &quot;scalable static analysis&quot;:
    - clang-ssaf-analyzer
    - clang-ssaf-format
    - clang-ssaf-linker
- Rebase patches:
  * assume-opensuse.patch
  * bolt-link-shared-library.patch
  * check-no-llvm-exegesis.patch
  * clang-riscv-triple.patch
  * default-to-i586.patch
  * llvm-fix-cov-test-i586.patch
  * tests-use-python3.patch
- Add patches to fix build:
  * llvm-FileCheck-avoid-x87.patch for i586.
  * llvm-fix-i586-build.patch for i586.
  * llvm-fix-riscv-build-gcc.patch for riscv64.
- Clean up update-alternatives migration.</comment>
    <requestid>1374358</requestid>
  </revision>
</revisionlist>
